        ],
        "en": [
          "Chez Jeannot is located in Etouvelles, and will be your stopover on the Laon - Soissons road.\nA traditional, refined restaurant awaits you at very affordable prices.\nThe restaurant offers 70 covers + a terrace that can seat 45 in summer, and can therefore accommodate meetings or seminars.\nAnd on the catering side, a fleet of 7 refrigerated and logistical vehicles travels the roads to cater for your various requirements, whether at your home or any other venue of your choice."
        ],
        "it": [
